        },
        "explain": {
          "ua": "Шкала впевненості: She's bound to win → She's likely to win → She may well win → She might win → She's unlikely to win → She can't possibly win. Might as well — нема кращого варіанту: The shop is closed, we might as well go home.",
          "ru": "Шкала уверенности: She's bound to win → She's likely to win → She may well win → She might win → She's unlikely to win → She can't possibly win. Might as well — нет лучшего варианта: The shop is closed, we might as well go home."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Don't worry, he's bound to call.",
            "ua": "Не хвилюйся, він обов'язково подзвонить.",
